  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Works for Dioxin Remediation at Bien Hoa Airbase Area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After completion of the Environmental Remediation of Dioxin Contamination at Danang Airport in 2018, at the request of the Government of Vietnam (GVN), the U.S. Government agreed to cooperate on dioxin remediation at Bien Hoa Airbase Area, the primary Agent Orange storage and handling site during the U.S.-Vietnam War and the largest remaining dioxin hotspot in Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
